{"title":"Career Roadmap · Quality Controller","role":"Quality Controller","summary":"Career objective: Become a Quality Controller specialising in printing and packaging quality, ensuring that raw materials, printed products, packaging structures and finished goods meet defined specifications for appearance, dimensions, colour, functionality, durability, safety and customer requirements.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Printing Technology","Packaging Materials","Quality Control","Testing","Process Engineering","Regulatory Awareness"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech Printing & Packaging Technology + printing, packaging, materials and QC fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Quality Executive / QC Engineer / Quality Controller"}],[{"text":"2033–2038"},{"text":"Senior Quality Engineer / Quality Specialist"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"Quality Lead / QA Manager / Packaging Quality Manager"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Quality Head / Technical Quality Manager / Packaging Quality Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during B.Tech/B.E.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering and manufacturing foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Basic mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Electrical/electronics fundamentals"},{"text":"Computer applications"},{"text":"Manufacturing fundamentals"},{"text":"Technical communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Begin understanding:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Material","Process","Printed/packaged product","Inspection","Testing","Customer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Printing